    "\n",
    "Report missing environmental measurements and `Unknown` occupancy-history values without modifying either raw CSV or removing environmental JSON payloads. Derived occupancy streams already exclude `previousoccupancystatus`; the report records how many `Unknown` and blank values are excluded. Missing environmental measurements remain as rows in the reduced wide dataset and are serialized as `NaN`, which pandas reads as a numeric missing value. Interpolation, if needed, is a separate analysis decision."
